#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"cbindgen\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, <xref "
