#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Thunderbird"
msgstr "Instalação do Thunderbird"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The build process for Thunderbird can use 8 GB or more of RAM when linking. "
"Make sure that you have adequate swap or RAM before continuing."
msgstr ""
"O processo de construção do Thunderbird pode usar oito (08) GB ou mais de "
"RAM durante a vinculação. Certifique-se de que você tem swap ou RAM "
"adequados antes de continuar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:155
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The configuration of <application>Thunderbird</application> is accomplished "
"by creating a <filename>mozconfig</filename> file containing the desired "
"configuration options. A default <filename>mozconfig</filename> is created "
"below. To see the entire list of available configuration options (and a "
"brief description of each), issue <command>./mach configure -- --help | "
"less</command>. Create the file with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"A configuração do <application>Thunderbird</application> é realizada "
"criando-se um arquivo <filename>mozconfig</filename> contendo as opções de "
"configuração desejadas. Um <filename>mozconfig</filename> padrão é criado "
"abaixo. Para ver a lista completa de opções de configuração disponíveis (e "
"uma breve descrição de cada uma), emita <command>./mach configure -- --help "
"| less</command>. Crie o arquivo com o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; mozconfig &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># If you have a multicore machine, all cores will be used.\n"
"\n"
"# If you have installed wireless-tools comment out this line:\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-necko-wifi\n"
"\n"
"# If you wish to use libproxy to determine proxy server information, you will\n"
"# need to install the libproxy package and then uncomment the option below:\n"
"#ac_add_options --enable-libproxy\n"
"\n"
"# Uncomment the following option if you have not installed PulseAudio\n"
"#ac_add_options --enable-audio-backends=alsa\n"
"\n"
"# Comment out following options if you have not installed\n"
"# recommended dependencies:\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-av1\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-libevent\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-libvpx\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-nspr\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-nss\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-webp\n"
"\n"
"# Thunderbird provides a copy of dav1d if it has not been installed. If you\n"
"# have not installed nasm and ffmpeg, uncomment the following line:\n"
"#ac_add_options --disable-av1\n"
"\n"
"# The BLFS editors recommend not changing anything below this line:\n"
"ac_add_options --prefix=/usr\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-application=comm/mail\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-crashreporter\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-updater\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-debug\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-debug-symbols\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-tests\n"
"\n"
"# This enables SIMD optimization in the shipped encoding_rs crate.\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-rust-simd\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-strip\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-install-strip\n"
"\n"
"# You cannot distribute the binary if you do this.\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-official-branding\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-system-ffi\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-system-pixman\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-jpeg\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-png\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-zlib\n"
"\n"
"# Using sandboxed wasm libraries has been moved to all builds instead\n"
"# of only mozilla automation builds. It requires extra llvm packages\n"
"# and was reported to seriously slow the build. Disable it.\n"
"ac_add_options --without-wasm-sandboxed-libraries</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; mozconfig &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># If you have a multicore machine, all cores will be used.\n"
"\n"
"# If you have installed wireless-tools comment out this line:\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-necko-wifi\n"
"\n"
"# If you wish to use libproxy to determine proxy server information, you will\n"
"# need to install the libproxy package and then uncomment the option below:\n"
"#ac_add_options --enable-libproxy\n"
"\n"
"# Uncomment the following option if you have not installed PulseAudio\n"
"#ac_add_options --enable-audio-backends=alsa\n"
"\n"
"# Comment out following options if you have not installed\n"
"# recommended dependencies:\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-av1\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-libevent\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-libvpx\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-nspr\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-nss\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-webp\n"
"\n"
"# Thunderbird provides a copy of dav1d if it has not been installed. If you\n"
"# have not installed nasm and ffmpeg, uncomment the following line:\n"
"#ac_add_options --disable-av1\n"
"\n"
"# The BLFS editors recommend not changing anything below this line:\n"
"ac_add_options --prefix=/usr\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-application=comm/mail\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-crashreporter\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-updater\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-debug\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-debug-symbols\n"
"ac_add_options --disable-tests\n"
"\n"
"# This enables SIMD optimization in the shipped encoding_rs crate.\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-rust-simd\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-strip\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-install-strip\n"
"\n"
"# You cannot distribute the binary if you do this.\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-official-branding\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-system-ffi\n"
"ac_add_options --enable-system-pixman\n"
"\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-jpeg\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-png\n"
"ac_add_options --with-system-zlib\n"
"\n"
"# Using sandboxed wasm libraries has been moved to all builds instead\n"
"# of only mozilla automation builds. It requires extra llvm packages\n"
"# and was reported to seriously slow the build. Disable it.\n"
"ac_add_options --without-wasm-sandboxed-libraries</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid "Next, fix building this package with Python 3.14:"
msgstr "Em seguida, corrija construir esse pacote com Python 3.14:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:238
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../thunderbird-&thunderbird-"
"version;esr-python_3.14_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../thunderbird-&thunderbird-"
"version;esr-python_3.14_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now invoke the Python <command>mach</command> script to compile "
"<application>Thunderbird</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Agora invoque o conjunto de comandos sequenciais Python "
"<command>mach</command> para compilar o "
"<application>Thunderbird</application>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:250
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>export MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE=none &amp;&amp;\n"
"export MOZBUILD_STATE_PATH=$(pwd)/mozbuild          &amp;&amp;\n"
"./mach build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>export MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE=none &amp;&amp;\n"
"export MOZBUILD_STATE_PATH=$(pwd)/mozbuild          &amp;&amp;\n"
"./mach build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:255
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:259
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Thunderbird</application> by running the following "
"commands as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Thunderbird</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:263
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE=none ./mach "
"install</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE=none ./mach "
"install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:267
#, xml-text
msgid "Empty the environment variables which were set above:"
msgstr "Esvazie as variáveis de ambiente que foram configuradas acima:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:270
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>unset MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset MOZBUILD_STATE_PATH</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>unset MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset MOZBUILD_STATE_PATH</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE=none</command>: Use the "
"system python to create a virtual environment for <command>mach</command> "
"without downloading any python wheels nor using the system python modules.  "
"This prevent version mismatches between system modules and bundled ones."
msgstr ""
"<command>MACH_BUILD_PYTHON_NATIVE_PACKAGE_SOURCE=none</command>: Use o "
"Python do sistema para criar um ambiente virtual para o "
"<command>mach</command> sem baixar nenhuma roda Python nem usar os módulos "
"Python do sistema. Isso evita incompatibilidades de versão entre os módulos "
"do sistema e os módulos incluídos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:293
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>./mach build --verbose</option>: Use this alternative if you need "
"details of which files are being compiled, together with any C or C++ flags "
"being used."
msgstr ""
"<option>./mach build --verbose</option>: Use essa alternativa se você "
"precisar de detalhes de quais arquivos estão sendo compilados, juntamente "
"com quaisquer sinalizadores C ou C++ sendo usados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:299
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>./mach build -jN</option>: The build should, by default, use all the"
" online CPU cores. If using all the cores causes the build to swap because "
"you have insufficient memory, using fewer cores can be faster."
msgstr ""
"<option>./mach build -jN</option>: A construção deveria, por padrão, usar "
"todos os Elementos de Processamento de CPU online. Se usar todos os "
"Elementos de Processamento fizer com que a construção use a área de troca "
"porque você tem memória insuficiente, usar menos Elementos de Processamento "
"poderá ser mais rápido."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:305
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option><envar>CC=gcc CXX=g++</envar></option>: BLFS used to prefer to use "
"gcc and g++ instead of upstream's defaults of the "
"<application>clang</application> programs. With the release of gcc-12 the "
"build takes longer with gcc and g++, primarily because of extra warnings, "
"and is bigger. Set these environment variables <emphasis>before you run the "
"configure script</emphasis> if you wish to continue to use gcc, g++. "
"Building with GCC on i?86 is currently broken."
msgstr ""
"<option><envar>CC=gcc CXX=g++</envar></option>: o BLFS costumava preferir "
"usar gcc e g++ em vez dos padrões de desenvolvedor(a) dos aplicativos "
"<application>clang</application>. Com o lançamento do gcc-12, a construção "
"demora mais tempo com gcc e g++, principalmente por causa de avisos extras, "
"e é maior. Configure essas variáveis de ambiente <emphasis>antes de executar"
" o conjunto de comandos sequenciais de configuração</emphasis> se desejar "
"continuar a usar gcc, g++. Construir com GCC em i?86 atualmente está "
"quebrado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:318
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Thunderbird"
msgstr "Configurando o Thunderbird"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:323
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If your Window Manager or Desktop Environment does not allow you to "
"configure a default browser, you can add a configuration parameter to "
"<application>Thunderbird</application> so that a browser will start when you"
" click on an Internet/intranet/local URL. The procedure to check or modify "
"any of the configuration parameters is quite simple and the instructions "
"here can be used to view or modify any of the parameters."
msgstr ""
"Se o teu Gerenciador de Janelas ou Ambiente de Área de Trabalho não te "
"permitir configurar um navegador padrão, você pode adicionar um parâmetro de"
" configuração ao <application>Thunderbird</application>, de forma que um "
"navegador seja iniciado quando você clicar em um URL da "
"Internet/intranet/local. O procedimento para verificar ou modificar qualquer"
" dos parâmetros de configuração é bastante simples e as instruções aqui "
"podem ser usadas para visualizar ou modificar quaisquer dos parâmetros."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/thunderbird.xml:332
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, open the configuration dialog by opening the <quote>Edit</quote> "
"drop-down menu. Choose <quote>Settings</quote> and then scroll down to the "
"bottom of the page. Then, click the <quote>Config Editor</quote> button. "
"Click on the <quote>I accept the risk!</quote> button.  This will display a "
"list of the configuration preferences and information related to each one. "
"You can use the <quote>Filter:</quote> bar to enter search criteria and "
"narrow down the listed items. Changing a preference can be done using two "
"methods. One, if the preference has a boolean value (True/False), simply "
"double-click on the preference to toggle the value and two, for other "
"preferences simply right-click on the desired line, choose "
"<quote>Modify</quote> from the menu and change the value. Creating new "
"preference items is accomplished in the same way, except choose "
"<quote>New</quote> from the menu and provide the desired data into the "
"fields when prompted."
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, abra a caixa de diálogo de configuração abrindo o menu suspenso "
"<quote>Editar</quote>. Escolha <quote>Configurações</quote> e, então, role "
"até o final da página. Em seguida, clique no botão <quote>Config "
"Editor</quote>. Clique no botão <quote>Eu aceito o risco!</quote>. Isso "
"exibirá uma lista de preferências de configuração e informações relacionadas"
" a cada uma delas. Você pode usar a barra <quote>Filtro:</quote> para "
"inserir critérios de pesquisa e restringir os itens listados. A mudança de "
"uma preferência pode ser feita usando-se dois métodos. Primeiro, se a "
"preferência tiver um valor booleano (Verdadeiro/Falso), simplesmente clique "
"duas vezes na preferência para alternar o valor; e dois, para outras "
"preferências, simplesmente clique com o botão direito na linha desejada, "
"escolha <quote>Modificar</quote> a partir do menu e mude o valor. A criação "
"de novos itens de preferência é realizada da mesma maneira, exceto que "
"escolha <quote>Novo</quote> a partir do menu e forneça os dados desejados "
"nos campos quando solicitado."

